# Scene manifests captured from a running Daz by smoke-test.ps1. They are a
# few MB each, they carry whatever local paths the capturing machine had, and
# they are only ever evidence for the investigation that captured them. Keep
# them out; if one matters, attach it to the ticket, where it has a reason
# beside it. (drift1-3.json were removed in DVB-29 for exactly this: 6.5 MB of
# manifests left over from the cumulative-drift hunt that cd9633a closed. Git
# history still has them.)
last-manifest.json
manifest.json
drift*.json
assets/
